12:00.720 --> 12:02.760
So I don't need to test anymore.

12:02.880 --> 12:05.520
Let's go integrate it in our main query.

12:05.520 --> 12:07.480
So we're going to do the same things over here.

12:07.480 --> 12:12.840
We're going to say left join and we're going to get our new CTE.

12:13.120 --> 12:18.760
So CC s and we have to do the join condition.

12:19.360 --> 12:20.600
Don't forget to change it.

12:20.600 --> 12:24.000
And we have to select our new nice information.

12:24.000 --> 12:26.200
It's going to be the customer segments.

12:26.200 --> 12:29.240
And now we can go and execute the whole thing.

12:29.240 --> 12:33.440
So we have now like four different cities and one main query.

12:33.480 --> 12:36.840
And now we can see in the output we got those three informations from the table.

12:36.840 --> 12:37.600
Customers.

12:37.600 --> 12:38.550
The first city.

12:38.630 --> 12:39.190
The second.

12:39.230 --> 12:39.710
Third.

12:39.750 --> 12:42.430
And this is our new column that we just created.

12:42.430 --> 12:47.230
So again, we have done this using a necessity like this.

12:47.270 --> 12:48.750
Let me just add it.

12:50.710 --> 12:54.150
