13:01.950 --> 13:04.190
And we have done it like step by step.

13:04.230 --> 13:09.630
And now you have like a feeling on how to write complex SQL queries using the help of the CTE.

13:09.670 --> 13:11.670
And we have done it like step by step.

13:11.670 --> 13:17.110
So as you can see, if you go through these scripts, you can understand okay, it is divided into multiple

13:17.110 --> 13:17.670
steps.

13:17.670 --> 13:22.910
